  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Low Carbon and Circular Economy Business Action in Canada (Phase II)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed Action brings together Europe&#xBF;s economic interests (promote trade and investment in environmental goods and services and support internationalisation of European SMEs thus contributing to creation of jobs and growth) with Europe&#xBF;s political ambition to remain at the forefront of addressing the global green transition. It could thus act as a significant example of European Economic Diplomacy in action in Canada.</narrative>
  </description>
